WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.100
Two neighbours meet in the street in the morning.

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.710
Jak jeździsz do pracy?

3
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.840
Zwykle jeżdżę tramwajem, ale dzisiaj idę pieszo.

4
00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:17.310
Usually by tram, a vehicle. Today on foot: a different verb.

5
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.080
Daleko?

6
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.810
Nie, dwadzieścia minut.

7
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.840
Jadę do Gdańska pociągiem.

8
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.360
One pair of verbs is for walking, the other for vehicles.

9
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:35.310
And each has a separate verb for habits.

10
00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.710
Zosia asks how he gets to work. What does she say?

11
00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.970
Jak jeździsz do pracy?

12
00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.330
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

13
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.890
Jak jeździsz do pracy?

14
00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.850
You are walking to school now. Say it.

15
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:03.630
Idę do szkoły.

16
00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.990
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

17
00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.070
Idę do szkoły.

18
00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:16.630
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
